You will need the following packages to build:
$ sudo apt-get install devscripts debhelper dh-autoreconf

Source in the cross toolchain before building.

Build the package from source:
$ ./make-debian.sh

Package generated is libclio_1.0.0_armhf.deb

After building the first time you will need to install to your local toolchain
so it can linked against with our projects:
$ ar x libclio_1.0.0_armhf.deb data.tar.gz
$ tar -xvf data.tar.gz
$ sed -i 's,fix=/usr,fix=/opt/hb6mxd_combo/toolchain,g' usr/lib/pkgconfig/clio.pc
$ sudo cp -RT ./usr /opt/hb6mxd_combo/toolchain/
$ rm -rf usr
$ rm data.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This package can be built and installed on local system also.
$ cd libclio-master
$ dpkg-buildpackage -us -uc -b

Package will be in base folder. To install:
$ cd ..
$ sudo dpkg -i libclio_1.0.0_amd64.deb

To uninstall:
$ sudo dpkg -r libclio

To cleanup after building:
$ cd libclio-master
$ git clean -fdx

